==Trivia==
This card is part of a narrative illustration with {{TCG ID|Genetic Apex|Venonat|16}}, {{TCG ID|Genetic Apex|Bellsprout|18}}, and the illustration rare {{TCG ID|Genetic Apex|Snorlax|250}} from the same set. In this illustration, Oddish can be seen by Snorlax's head; the Snorlax card reveals that Oddish is stuck in the northern stretch of [[Kanto]] {{rt|12|Kanto}}, which Snorlax is blocking. Together, these cards form the "A Big Snorlax Nuisance" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]]. Oddish, Venonat, and Bellsprout also have the same stats and an attack that does 20 damage for one {{e|Grass}} Energy.

===Origin===
*'''Ram''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Zubat|70}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

